\nBoards and Committees\nCounty Jobs\nCounty Staff\nCounty Supervisors\nAgendas and Minutes\nEmployment Opportunities\nForms and Documents\nOpen Bids & RFPs\nDriver License\nMotor Vehicles\nProperty Tax\nTax Sale\nFinance\nWinter Snow\nProjects\nRaccoon River Valley Trail\nCITY/SCHOOL ELECTION\nElections\nGENERAL ELECTION\nPassports\nPRIMARY ELECTION\nThomas Laehn\nAbout the Assessor\nAssessment Flow Chart\nCredits & Exemptions\nMarket Value and Appeals\nFamily Farm Tax Credit\nForrest & Fruit Tree\nHomestead Tax Credit\nMilitary Tax Exemption\nPollution Control Exemption\nDriver's License\nE-Notifications\nMarriage License\nPassports\nVehicle License\nTaxes\nVehicle Registration Fee\nMy Vehicle\nTo Vote\nCommission Agenda & Minutes\n|\nGreene County IA\n|\nHome\nGovernment\nResidents\nBusiness\nVisitors\nHow Do I?\nTreasurer\nDriver License\nMotor Vehicles\nProperty Tax\nTax Sale\nHome > Departments >\nTreasurer\nTreasurer's Responsibilities include these duties:\nIssue vehicle titles, registrations and collect vehicle fees.\nIssue and renew driver’s licenses for the Iowa Department of Transportation.\nAdminister written and driving tests, including commercial testing, and Department of Transportation re-examinations as needed.\nCollect property taxes, mobile home tax, special assessments and other miscellaneous taxes.\nRespond to tax inquiries from property owners, financial institutions, real estate agents, abstractors and appraisers.\nAdminister the Iowa Property Tax Credit Program and conduct tax sales for the collection of delinquent taxes.\nReceipt and record all funds collected by county departments.\nAdminister financial services for banking, cash management and investments.\nDistribute collected funds to schools, cities and other taxing agencies.\nFor more details https://www.iowatreasurers.org/treshome.php?idCounty=37\nMore Information:\nPay Taxes and Car Tags - www.iowatreasurers.org\nwww.iowadot.gov\nDriver License\nMotor Vehicles\nProperty Tax\nTax Sale\nGreene County Courthouse\nCourthouse hours 8:00 am – 4:30 pm\n114 N. Chestnut Street Jefferson, IA 50129\nHome | Contact Us | Site Map | Accessibility\nGovernment Websites by MunicipalCMS\n0",
